      "message": "I think, I did not completely understand what are you trying to refer.\n\nCould you please clarify if you mean that APM should provide compressed profiles even when clients are not requesting compression offload?\n\nMy understanding was that for compressed profiles clients has to request specifically (as they are going to handle the callback threads as well for data).\n\nEven in case of client directly using AudioTrack.java, clients need to set setoffload API, and internally in JNI side, compress flags are added ( this is very much similar to NuPlayer adding compress offload flags )\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/jni/android_media_AudioTrack.cpp;l\u003d373?q\u003dandroid_media_AudioTrack.cpp",
